# Pinned Swift WASI SDK identifier for CI validation (Phase 1).
# Full Swift-Wasm extension builds are Phase 11.
# Update this file intentionally when bumping the SDK; CI job `wasi-sdk` must pass.
#
# Format: first non-comment, non-empty line is the SDK id substring matched by `swift sdk list`.
# Official install example (Swift 6.3.3):
#   swift sdk install \
#     https://download.swift.org/swift-6.3.3-release/wasm-sdk/swift-6.3.3-RELEASE/swift-6.3.3-RELEASE_wasm.artifactbundle.tar.gz \
#     --checksum cabfa08b73bb8ac783927ecd15fa386e99d0c139c5f232445067bcf58379cae7
# IDs after install typically include `swift-6.3.3-RELEASE_wasm`.

swift-6.3.3-RELEASE_wasm
